# Frontend

Follow [frontend/CONVENTIONS.md](frontend/CONVENTIONS.md).

- New UI lives in `src/features/<name>/`. `components/ui` is shadcn only. Features do not import other features; compose in `app/` / router.
- Zustand: `authStore` (profile and session status, no tokens), `uploadStore` (browser PUT), `assetsStore` (library + SSE patches), `eventsStore` (single EventSource). Both tokens are httpOnly cookies; the client never sees them.
- One `EventSource` for the whole app. Cards subscribe to the store. No polling `GET` on an interval. No WebSocket for job progress.
- API errors: show `error.message`, branch on `error.code`. Uploads: presign → PUT to storage → complete, never through the api body.
- Functional components only. Do not grow `App.tsx` with sandbox widgets.
